<div class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-950">
  <header class="h-20 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto h-full px-6 md:px-12 flex items-center justify-between">
      <%= link_to root_path, class: "flex items-center gap-2" do %>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-blue-600 text-3xl">medical_services</span>
        <span class="font-bold text-2xl">MedHora</span>
      <% end %>

      <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">Consulta médica asistida por IA</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[320px_1fr] gap-8">
      <aside class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 mb-3">Consulta IA</p>
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Cuéntanos qué síntomas tienes</h1>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            La IA te hará preguntas de seguimiento para orientar mejor tu caso.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-blue-950 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">Importante</h2>
          <p class="text-blue-100 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">
            MedHora no sustituye una consulta médica profesional. Si presentas una emergencia, llama a servicios de emergencia.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <section class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden min-h-[720px] flex flex-col">
        <div class="px-6 py-5 border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-blue-600">smart_toy</span>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">MedHora AI</h2>
              <p class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold">● En línea</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <%= link_to "Salir", root_path, class: "text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 hover:text-blue-600" %>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50">
          <div class="flex justify-start">
            <div class="max-w-[85%] md:max-w-[65%] bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 px-5 py-4 rounded-3xl rounded-tl-none shadow-sm">
              <p class="text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
                Hola 👋 Soy MedHora AI. Describe qué síntomas tienes, desde cuándo los presentas y qué tan intensos son.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-slate-200 p-4 md:p-6 bg-white">
          <form class="flex items-end gap-3">
            <textarea
              rows="1"
              placeholder="Escribe tus síntomas..."
              class="flex-1 resize-none rounded-2xl border-slate-300 px-5 py-4 text-sm focus:border-blue-600 focus:ring-blue-600"></textarea>

            <button
              type="button"
              class="bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 font-bold hover:bg-blue-700 transition flex items-center gap-2">
              Enviar
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">send</span>
            </button>
          </form>

          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-3 text-center">
            Esta orientación es informativa y no reemplaza atención médica profesional.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
